:: Connudatus Street Flash
<<if $xchange.blackmail.activeQuest?.id is 12>><<set $xchange.blackmail.activeQuest.flashedPeople++>><</if>>
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You spend some time looking around for a suitable target, until you spot a small pause in the flow of people, as a <<person1>><<person>> approaches.
<br><br>

With your pulse racing, you take a step in front of <<him>> and
<<if $worn.lower.skirt is 1>>
    raise your skirt to reveal your <<undies>>.
<<elseif $player.gender_appearance is "f">>
    lower your top enough to give a glimpse of your <<undertop>>.
<<else>>
    lower your pants to reveal your <<undies>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

With the <<persons>> mouth agape, you run off into the distance in an attempt to lose yourself in the crowd.